    turnFlow: "1. **The Turn-Up**: Dealer flips a card for trumps. 2. **The Beg**: Non-dealer (Eldest) can either 'Stand' (accept trump) or 'Beg'. 3. **The Gift/Run**: If they beg, dealer can: \n   - 'Gift' 1 point to the opponent and keep the trump suit.\n   - OR 'Run the cards': Deal 3 more cards to each player. Flip a new trump. (If the new suit is the same as the first, keep running 3 at a time until a different suit appears).\n4. **Discarding**: If the cards were run, players discard down to exactly 6 cards before play starts. 5. **Play**: Follow suit or trump. 6. **Scoring**: Points awarded in order: High, Low, Jack, Game.",
